      "source": "theorem _root_.CompressionEval.fresh_sets_logic_10 {α β : Type*} (f : α → β) (s : Set α) (a b : α) (ha : a ∈ s) (hab : f a=f b) :\n  f b ∈ f '' s ∧ (f '' s).Nonempty :=\nby exact ⟨⟨a,ha,hab⟩, ⟨f a, a, ha, rfl⟩⟩",
